	quest.0B61F5DF33350C0A.quest_desc: ["Theres some weird not blobbys that that live on slimey islands. they dont talk but they taste breddy gud. if I find the blue raspberry flavor thatd be way better than vegtables."]
	quest.0B61F5DF33350C0A.title: "the other blobb."
